    "generate_outline": "Students receive the Boba Run Splitter seed program and the following inputs: 4 drinks, $5.50 per drink, $2.00 coupon, 3 friends. Task: Write down (1) the exact output text, character for character, and (2) the final value of every variable. Commit predictions in writing before touching a keyboard.",
    "generate_supplied_code": "# Boba Run Splitter\r\n# Totals a boba order, adds a tip, and splits it among friends.\r\n\r\nprint(\"Boba Run Splitter\")\r\n\r\nnum_drinks = int(input(\"How many drinks? \"))\r\ndrink_price = float(input(\"Price per drink: \"))\r\ncoupon = float(input(\"Coupon amount: \"))\r\nnum_friends = int(input(\"How many friends are splitting? \"))\r\n\r\nsubtotal = num_drinks * drink_price - coupon\r\ntotal_cents = round(subtotal * 1.18 * 100)\r\n\r\nper_person = round(total_cents / num_friends)\r\nleftover_cents = total_cents % num_friends\r\n\r\nprint(\"Each person pays: $\" + str(per_person / 100))\r\nprint(\"Leftover cents: \" + str(leftover_cents))\r\nprint(\"Whoever picked the shop covers the leftover!\")"
